{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"files\":[{\"content\":\"#include <algorithm>\\n#include <iostream>\\n#include <vector>\\n\\nusing namespace std;\\n\\nconst int MOD = 1000000007;\\n\\nint main() {\\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);\\n    cin.tie(nullptr);\\n\\n    int n, m;\\n    if (!(cin >> n >> m)) return 0;\\n\\n    vector<vector<int>> blocked(n);\\n    for (int c = 0; c < m; ++c) {\\n        int i, j;\\n        cin >> i >> j;\\n        blocked[i].push_back(j);\\n    }\\n    for (auto& row : blocked) {\\n        sort(row.begin(), row.end());\\n        row.erase(unique(row.begin(), row.end()), row.end());\\n    }\\n\\n    vector<int> dp(n, 0);\\n    dp[0] = 1;\\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) {\\n        int begin = 0;\\n        int left = 0;\\n        for (int obstacle : blocked[i]) {\\n            for (int j = begin; j < obstacle; ++j) {\\n                int sum = dp[j] + left;\\n                if (sum >= MOD) sum -= MOD;\\n                dp[j] = sum;\\n                left = sum;\\n            }\\n            dp[obstacle] = 0;\\n            left = 0;\\n            begin = obstacle + 1;\\n        }\\n        for (int j = begin; j < n; ++j) {\\n            int sum = dp[j] + left;\\n            if (sum >= MOD) sum -= MOD;\\n            dp[j] = sum;\\n            left = sum;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    cout << dp[n - 1] << '\\\\n';\\n    return 0;\\n}\\n\",\"path\":\"src/solution.cpp\"}],\"hypothesis\":\"A single contiguous DP row and sorted per-row obstacle lists should reduce memory traffic and allocation while removing obstacle checks from unobstructed spans.\",\"notes\":\"Preserves duplicate obstacles, blocked endpoints, and n=1. Both summands are reduced residues, so their sum fits signed int. No commands or measurements performed.\",\"research\":{\"queries\":[],\"urls\":[]},\"sources_kept\":[],\"transformations\":[\"Replace the quadratic obstacle bitmap with sorted, deduplicated per-row column lists.\",\"Process unobstructed spans using one in-place DP row, eliminating row copies and per-cell obstacle lookups.\",\"Replace remainder with conditional subtraction and enable buffered standard input without stream synchronization.\"]}"}}
